OL,3,GNEWSANew homes pose sewage risk, warns 
OL,4,Awater firm                             
OL,6,FA new housing estate would lead to an  
OL,7,F"unacceptable risk" of sewage flooding 
OL,8,Finto a town, a water firm has warned.  
OL,10,FAnglian Water has told North Norfolk   
OL,11,FDistrict Council that its network could
OL,12,Fnot cope with 150 homes being built in 
OL,13,FStalham.                               
OL,15,FIts opposition has been backed by the  
OL,16,Ftown council which said there had been 
OL,17,Fseveral burst pipes in recent months   
OL,18,Fand it was "seriously concerned".      
